~ observe_mobile_module
思考: hal的[kw=mobile_module]。
=> END

~ observe_large_cart
思考: 一辆[kw=large_cart]。
=> END

~ observe_auto_bookcase
思考: 一架[kw=auto_bookcase]
=> END

~ observe_fallen_book
思考: [kw=fallen_book]
=> END

~ obeserve_delivery_box
思考: 大推车上的[kw=delivery_box]
=> END


~ submit
if GameState.get_choice("keyword_submission") == "hal+mobile_module":
	if GameState.get_flag("large_cart_moved"):
		=> hal_get_mobile_module
	else:
		=> move_to_hal
elif GameState.get_choice("keyword_submission") == "auto_bookcase+mobile_module":
	=> move_to_auto_bookcase
elif GameState.get_choice("keyword_submission") == "open_window":
	=> open_window
elif GameState.get_choice("keyword_submission") == "impact+large_cart":
	if GameState.get_flag("switch_can_open"):
		=> large_cart_move
	else:
		思考: 大推车仍挡住移动模块靠近hal的路线。
else:
	思考: 暂时不知道怎样用这个组合行动。
=> END

~ move_to_hal
if GameState.get_flag("large_cart_moved"):
	=> hal_get_mobile_module
elif GameState.get_flag("chapter1_book_fallen"):
	思考: 大推车仍挡住移动模块靠近hal的路线。
else:
	do StudyRoom1.first_collision()
	do GameState.set_flag("chapter1_book_fallen", true)
	思考: 移动模块停在大推车右边。发生了[kw=impact]，压住快递箱的书掉落了。
=> END

~ move_to_auto_bookcase
do StudyRoom1.second_collision()
思考: 自动书柜的同等高度右侧有用力撞击可以触发的[kw=switch]
do GameState.set_flag("auto_bookcase_switch", true)
if GameState.get_flag("large_cart_switch") and GameState.get_flag("auto_bookcase_switch"):
	提示: [kw=switch]的压缩内容发生改变
=> END

~ open_window
do StudyRoom1.open_window()
思考: 快递箱基本没什么东西，[kw=weight]不是导致无法移动的原因
=> END

~ large_cart_move
do StudyRoom1.large_cart_move()
do GameState.set_flag("large_cart_moved", true)
=> END

~ hal_get_mobile_module
do StudyRoom1.hal_get_mobile_module()
do GameState.set_flag("hal_get_mobile_module", true)
do GameState.set_flag("chapter1_completed", true)
系统: 移动模块已连接，力量限制已解除。移动功能已恢复。
=> END
